<p>Dil me akber ke hai sina baba<br />
Jaa'n balab hai ye neemjaa'n baba</p>

<p>Aap ke hath thar tharaate hai<br />
Dekh kar khainchiye sina baba</p>

<p>Dekhne mujhko aaye hai dekho<br />
Daadijaa'n aur daadajaa'n baba</p>

<p>Aaap itna qayaal rakhiye ga<br />
ran me aaye na meri maa baba</p>

<p>Mera ye haal dekh kar warna<br />
jaan dedegi meri maa baba</p>

<p>Ab to jaate hai hum khuda hafiz<br />
Dam hai kuch dam ka mehmaa'n baba</p>

<p>Reh gayi dil me nok barchi ki<br />
aagayi hai labo'n pa jaa'n baba</p>

<p>kehkar akber ye mar gaye hilmi<br />
qatm hoti hai daastaa'n baba<br />
</p>